Also enable `allout-auto-activation' for this to take effect upon
visiting an outline.

When this is set you can disable allout widgets in select files
by setting `allout-widgets-mode-inhibit'.

Instead of setting `allout-widgets-auto-activation' you can
explicitly invoke `allout-widgets-mode' in allout buffers where
you want allout widgets operation.

See `allout-widgets-mode' for allout widgets mode features.#@2 #@75 Directory on `image-load-path' holding allout icons for dark backgrounds.#@76 Directory on `image-load-path' holding allout icons for light backgrounds.#@76 File extensions for the icon graphic format types, in order of preference.#@66 Identify the outline's icon theme to use with a dark background.#@67 Identify the outline's icon theme to use with a light background.#@58 Default properties item widget images in mainline Emacs.#@50 Default properties item widget images in XEmacs.#@227 Retain timing info of the last cooperative redecoration.

