#@54 Directory for temporary files made by `arc-mode.el'.#@2 #@185 Regexp recognizing archive files names that are not local.
A non-local file is one whose file name is not proper outside Emacs.
A local copy of the archive will be used when updating.#@53 Hook run when an archive member has been extracted.#@132 If non-nil, opening an archive with a single file visits that file.
If nil, visiting such an archive displays the archive summary.#@30 Columns hidden from display.#@58 Columns hidden when `archive-alternate-display' is used.
