The full `format-spec' formatting syntax is supported.#@57 Seconds after which the battery status will be updated.#@108 Upper bound of low battery load percentage.
A battery load percentage below this number is considered low.#@118 Upper bound of critical battery load percentage.
A battery load percentage below this number is considered critical.#@92 Face used in mode line string when battery load is low.
