(custom-declare-face 'bookmark-face '((((class grayscale) (background light)) :foreground "DimGray") (((class grayscale) (background dark)) :foreground "LightGray") (((class color) (background light)) :foreground "DarkOrange1" :distant-foreground "DarkOrange3") (((class color) (background dark)) :foreground "DarkOrange1" :distant-foreground "Orange1")) '(#$ . 6305) :version "28.1")#@288 Keymap containing bindings to bookmark functions.
It is not bound to any key by default: to bind it
