 dollar-sign character.  Hash characters in other contexts will still
 follow whatever the syntax table says about the hash character.

 ("\\(\='\\).\\(\='\\)"
  (1 "\"")
  (2 "\""))

 gives a pair of apostrophes, which surround a single character, a
