When `ido-everywhere' is non-nil, the commands in this list will read
the directory using `ido-read-directory-name'.#@184 List of commands which shall not read file names the Ido way.
When `ido-everywhere' is non-nil, the commands in this list will read
the file name using normal `read-file-name' style.#@126 List of functions to call before calling a fallback command.
The fallback command is passed as an argument to the functions.#@30 Keymap for all Ido commands.
