(defalias 'ucs-normalize-sort #[257 "\300\301\"\207" [sort #[514 "\300\301\"\262\300\301\"\262W\207" [get-char-code-property canonical-combining-class] 7 (#$ . 30727)]] 4 (#$ . 30666)])#@139 Compose CHARS by COMPOSITION-PREDICATE.
CHARS must be sorted and normalized in starter-combining pairs.

(fn CHARS COMPOSITION-PREDICATE)
(defalias 'ucs-normalize-compose-chars #[514 "\211\203r␀@\300\211\211A\300\211\211\203i␀@\262\301\302\"\262\262\203)␀W\203@␀\303D\n\"\211\262\203@␀\211\262\300\262\202b␀\304U\203Y␀\237B\244\262\262\300\262\202b␀\262B\262A\262\202␀\237B\244\207\207" [nil get-char-code-property canonical-combining-class ucs-normalize-primary-composite 0] 14 (#$ . 203778)])#@137 Try composing CHARS by COMPOSITION-PREDICATE.
If COMPOSITION-PREDICATE is not given, then do nothing.

(fn CHARS COMPOSITION-PREDICATE)
(defalias 'ucs-normalize-block-compose-chars #[514 "\300!\203\f␀\301\"\207\207" [ucs-normalize-sort ucs-normalize-compose-chars] 6 (#$ . 204323)])#@217 Quick-Check List for DECOMPOSITION-TRANSLATION and COMPOSITION-PREDICATE.
