(fn TOP BOT ARG)#@78 Parse a rectangle as a matrix of numbers and sum its rows.

(fn TOP BOT ARG)#@94 Start Calc Embedded mode on the formula surrounding point.

(fn ARG &optional END OBEG OEND)#@155 Scan the current editing buffer for all embedded := and => formulas.
