(fn CHAR)#@209 Convert `VIQR' mnemonics of the current region to Vietnamese characters.
When called from a program, expects two arguments,
positions (integers or markers) specifying the stretch of the region.

(fn FROM TO)#@74 Convert `VIQR' mnemonics of the current buffer to Vietnamese characters.#@209 Convert Vietnamese characters of the current region to `VIQR' mnemonics.
When called from a program, expects two arguments,
positions (integers or markers) specifying the stretch of the region.

(fn FROM TO)#@74 Convert Vietnamese characters of the current buffer to `VIQR' mnemonics.#@148 Non-nil if View mode is enabled.
Don't change this variable directly, you must change it by one of the
functions that enable or disable view mode.
