abbrev table and syntax table:

  `mpc-songs-mode-map', `mpc-songs-mode-abbrev-table' and
`mpc-songs-mode-syntax-table'

which more-or-less shadow mpc-mode's corresponding tables.

In addition to any hooks its parent mode might have run, this mode runs
the hook `mpc-songs-mode-hook', as the final or penultimate step during
initialization.

