This is only effective if supported by your mouse or touchpad.#@2 #@49 Number of seconds between each momentum scroll.#@56 The maximum duration in seconds of momentum scrolling.#@74 The minimum scrolled pixels per second before momentum scrolling starts.#@74 Factor applied to the initial velocity before momentum scrolling begins.#@107 Pixels that must be scrolled before an animation is performed.
