`act-and-exit', `exit', `exit-prefix', `recenter', `scroll-up',
`scroll-down', `scroll-other-window', `scroll-other-window-down',
`edit', `edit-replacement', `edit-replacement-exact-case',
`delete-and-edit', `automatic', `backup', `undo', `undo-all',
`quit', and `help'.

