(defalias 'server-done #[0 "\205,␀\304 \203␀\305\211\306 *\210\202)␀\307 \203)␀\203)␀\310\311\312Q!\203)␀\306 \210\313p!\207" [server-buffer-clients buffer-backed-up version-control buffer-file-name server-temp-file-p nil save-buffer buffer-modified-p y-or-n-p "Save file " "? " server-buffer-done] 4 (#$ . 46076)])#@351 Ask before exiting Emacs if it has other live clients.
A "live client" is a client with at least one live buffer
