(defalias 'kill-append #[514 "@\304\203␀P\202␀PG\305U\206␀\306\305\307#?\"\266	\205C␀\n?\205C␀\211A\211@\2039␀AA\262\202,␀\205A␀A\241\266\202\207" [kill-ring kill-append-merge-undo buffer-read-only buffer-undo-list kill-new 0 get-text-property yank-handler] 9 (#$ . 184694)])#@251 Whether rotating the kill ring changes the window system selection.
If non-nil, whenever the kill ring is rotated (usually via the
