(defalias 'strokes-toggle-strokes-buffer #[256 "\211\203\f␀\301!\302V\202␀?\211\207" [strokes-use-strokes-buffer prefix-numeric-value 0] 3 (#$ . 31252) "P"])#@502 Create an XPM pixmap for the given STROKE in buffer " *strokes-xpm*".
